id: pm-25b7tg
title: "GH-766: Windows nightly extension timeout and merge-safety cleanup EBUSY"
description: "Scheduled Nightly Validation run 30246735868 at commit f4817e0 passed 6,442 tests but failed only on Windows Node 24: the extension install-source helper branch test exceeded the generic 5 second timeout and merge-safety cleanup failed with EBUSY on a temporary directory. Restore deterministic Windows completion without widening repository-wide timeouts."
